{"id":"torrey:anger-of-god-the","source":"torrey","name":"Anger Of God, The","slug":"anger-of-god-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Averted by Christ — Lu 2:11,14; Ro 5:9; 2Co 5:18,19; Eph 2:14,17; Col 1:20; 1Th 1:10.","refs":[["Luke",2,11,2,11],["Luke",2,14,2,14],["Rom",5,9,5,9],["2Cor",5,18,5,18],["2Cor",5,19,5,19],["Eph",2,14,2,14],["Eph",2,17,2,17],["Col",1,20,1,20],["1Thess",1,10,1,10]]},{"text":"Is averted from them that believe — Joh 3:14-18; Ro 3:25; 5:1.","refs":[["John",3,14,3,18],["Rom",3,25,3,25],["Rom",5,1,5,1]]},{"text":"Is averted upon confession of sin and repentance — Job 33:27,28; Ps 106:43-45; Jer 3:12,13; 18:7,8; 31:18-20; Joe 2:12-14; Lu 15:18-20.","refs":[["Job",33,27,33,27],["Job",33,28,33,28],["Ps",106,43,106,45],["Jer",3,12,3,12],["Jer",3,13,3,13],["Jer",18,7,18,7],["Jer",18,8,18,8],["Jer",31,18,31,20],["Joel",2,12,2,14],["Luke",15,18,15,20]]},{"text":"Is slow — Ps 103:8; Isa 48:9; Jon 4:2; Na 1:3.","refs":[["Ps",103,8,103,8],["Isa",48,9,48,9],["Jonah",4,2,4,2],["Nah",1,3,1,3]]},{"text":"Is righteous — Ps 58:10,11; La 1:18; Ro 2:6,8; 3:5,6; Re 16:6,7.","refs":[["Ps",58,10,58,10],["Ps",58,11,58,11],["Lam",1,18,1,18],["Rom",2,6,2,6],["Rom",2,8,2,8],["Rom",3,5,3,5],["Rom",3,6,3,6],["Rev",16,6,16,6],["Rev",16,7,16,7]]},{"text":"The justice of, not to be questioned — Ro 9:18,20,22.","refs":[["Rom",9,18,9,18],["Rom",9,20,9,20],["Rom",9,22,9,22]]},{"text":"Manifested in terrors — Ex 14:24; Ps 76:6-8; Jer 10:10; La 2:20-22.","refs":[["Exod",14,24,14,24],["Ps",76,6,76,8],["Jer",10,10,10,10],["Lam",2,20,2,22]]},{"text":"Manifested in judgments and afflictions — Job 21:17; Ps 78:49-51; 90:7; Isa 9:19; Jer 7:20; Eze 7:19; Heb 3:17.","refs":[["Job",21,17,21,17],["Ps",78,49,78,51],["Ps",90,7,90,7],["Isa",9,19,9,19],["Jer",7,20,7,20],["Ezek",7,19,7,19],["Heb",3,17,3,17]]},{"text":"Cannot be resisted — Job 9:13; 14:13; Ps 76:7; Na 1:6.","refs":[["Job",9,13,9,13],["Job",14,13,14,13],["Ps",76,7,76,7],["Nah",1,6,1,6]]},{"text":"Aggravated by continual prov